  "dct_description_sm": [
    "# Pakistan Floods: Damage and Flood Proxy Maps, Aug 2022 The **Earth Observatory of Singapore – Remote Sensing Lab (EOS-RS)** produced these damage and flood proxy maps for Pakistan Floods (Aug 2022) from synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite images. Each map is a separate ZIP below with its GeoTIFF, a KMZ for Google Earth, the PNG figures and a text file describing how it was made and how to read it. ## Maps in this dataset - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 1 Sep 2022, v0.8** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 1 Sep 2022, v0.8** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 30 Aug 2022, v0.8** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 30 Aug 2022, v0.8** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 29 Aug 2022, v0.8** - **EOS-RS Damage Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 29 Aug 2022, v0.8** - **EOS-RS Flood Proxy Map: Pakistan, Floods, 21 Aug 2022, v0.3** **More map details and files:** **More map details and files:** **Credits:** Earth Observatory of Singapore - Remote Sensing Lab (EOS-RS), Advanced Rapid Imaging and Analysis (ARIA), NASA-JPL/Caltech, Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2022)"
